{"4926160":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dice Sort Together: Arcane Hall","steam_appid":4926160,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"The Arcane Hall's portal has torn open, and thousands of dice, cups, and trinkets now bury every floorboard. This is a cozy, casual tidy-up and organizing simulator with an immersive atmosphere, where chaos transforms into perfect order, one satisfying clack at a time - alone, or together with up to three friends in online co-op.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/15d2a30c076758ce84f813fa2daa582e.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/15d2a30c076758ce84f813fa2daa582e.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/15d2a30c076758ce84f813fa2daa582e.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hall Buried in Dice<\/h2>Step into a first-person organizing simulator where nearly 4,400 dice and tabletop pieces are scattered across nine departments: D4, D6, D8, D10, D12, D20, Dice Sets, Cups &amp; Towers, and Table Trinkets. Raise a hand and unlock the magical ability to Pull scattered pieces toward you, watching them spiral into your grip in a shimmer of light - pure visual satisfaction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/8bd76477092a954ba6c9a6bdb55b3d30.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/8bd76477092a954ba6c9a6bdb55b3d30.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/8bd76477092a954ba6c9a6bdb55b3d30.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Know Where It Belongs<\/h2>Not sure where a piece goes? ShelfCheck lights up its home shelf with a glowing outline, so every die and trinket finds its section without guesswork. Pick it up, spot its shelf, and put it in place - a calm, steady rhythm of clack, clack, clack, and one quiet moment of satisfaction after another.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/32fdcf07d9daba7a4549debe9bd6b977.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/32fdcf07d9daba7a4549debe9bd6b977.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/32fdcf07d9daba7a4549debe9bd6b977.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw It Home<\/h2>Level up your magic skills and AutoShelve turns a well-aimed throw into pure strategic efficiency - toss a die across the hall and watch it sail straight into its slot, trailing a streak of glowing magic behind it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/432f2864a398f81a87f87dd67189eae0.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/432f2864a398f81a87f87dd67189eae0.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/432f2864a398f81a87f87dd67189eae0.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Better Together<\/h2>Bring up to three friends into the same hall in online co-op - up to 4 players total. Everyone shares one skill tree, so every Pull, Search, and AutoShelve throw brings the departments closer to full, and the hall closer to whole again. It's a cozy tidy up you can share with friends, or a peaceful solo escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/194d28ab07732164c697678cf1e87ef2.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/194d28ab07732164c697678cf1e87ef2.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/194d28ab07732164c697678cf1e87ef2.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A cozy, first-person organizing simulator with a relaxing, immersive arcane atmosphere<br><\/li><li>Solo play or online co-op tidy up for up to 4 players<br><\/li><li>4,400+ dice and tabletop pieces to sort across 9 departments<br><\/li><li>Satisfying, ASMR-style real dice sounds: clack, rattle, tumble, and cascade<br><\/li><li>Unlock powerful magical abilities and skill upgrades in a shared magic skill tree: Pull, ShelfCheck, Search, Sort, and AutoShelve throw<br><\/li><li>9 Oracle Cabinet perks to customize your keeper<br><\/li><li>Original Minstrel Organ soundtrack<br><\/li><li>10 fantasy keepers to play as, each with their own hat<br><\/li><li>Four glowing themes to sort by: Arcane, Ember, Frost, and Verdant<br><\/li><li>No time limit, low-pressure gameplay - relax and tidy up at your own pace<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"The Arcane Hall's portal has torn open, and thousands of dice, cups, and trinkets now bury every floorboard. This is a cozy, casual tidy-up and organizing simulator with an immersive atmosphere, where chaos transforms into perfect order, one satisfying clack at a time - alone, or together with up to three friends in online co-op.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/15d2a30c076758ce84f813fa2daa582e.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/15d2a30c076758ce84f813fa2daa582e.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/15d2a30c076758ce84f813fa2daa582e.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hall Buried in Dice<\/h2>Step into a first-person organizing simulator where nearly 4,400 dice and tabletop pieces are scattered across nine departments: D4, D6, D8, D10, D12, D20, Dice Sets, Cups &amp; Towers, and Table Trinkets. Raise a hand and unlock the magical ability to Pull scattered pieces toward you, watching them spiral into your grip in a shimmer of light - pure visual satisfaction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/8bd76477092a954ba6c9a6bdb55b3d30.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/8bd76477092a954ba6c9a6bdb55b3d30.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/8bd76477092a954ba6c9a6bdb55b3d30.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Know Where It Belongs<\/h2>Not sure where a piece goes? ShelfCheck lights up its home shelf with a glowing outline, so every die and trinket finds its section without guesswork. Pick it up, spot its shelf, and put it in place - a calm, steady rhythm of clack, clack, clack, and one quiet moment of satisfaction after another.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/32fdcf07d9daba7a4549debe9bd6b977.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/32fdcf07d9daba7a4549debe9bd6b977.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/32fdcf07d9daba7a4549debe9bd6b977.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw It Home<\/h2>Level up your magic skills and AutoShelve turns a well-aimed throw into pure strategic efficiency - toss a die across the hall and watch it sail straight into its slot, trailing a streak of glowing magic behind it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/432f2864a398f81a87f87dd67189eae0.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/432f2864a398f81a87f87dd67189eae0.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/432f2864a398f81a87f87dd67189eae0.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Better Together<\/h2>Bring up to three friends into the same hall in online co-op - up to 4 players total. Everyone shares one skill tree, so every Pull, Search, and AutoShelve throw brings the departments closer to full, and the hall closer to whole again. It's a cozy tidy up you can share with friends, or a peaceful solo escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/194d28ab07732164c697678cf1e87ef2.poster.avif?t=1793751756\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/194d28ab07732164c697678cf1e87ef2.webm?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/extras\/194d28ab07732164c697678cf1e87ef2.mp4?t=1793751756\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A cozy, first-person organizing simulator with a relaxing, immersive arcane atmosphere<br><\/li><li>Solo play or online co-op tidy up for up to 4 players<br><\/li><li>4,400+ dice and tabletop pieces to sort across 9 departments<br><\/li><li>Satisfying, ASMR-style real dice sounds: clack, rattle, tumble, and cascade<br><\/li><li>Unlock powerful magical abilities and skill upgrades in a shared magic skill tree: Pull, ShelfCheck, Search, Sort, and AutoShelve throw<br><\/li><li>9 Oracle Cabinet perks to customize your keeper<br><\/li><li>Original Minstrel Organ soundtrack<br><\/li><li>10 fantasy keepers to play as, each with their own hat<br><\/li><li>Four glowing themes to sort by: Arcane, Ember, Frost, and Verdant<br><\/li><li>No time limit, low-pressure gameplay - relax and tidy up at your own pace<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A cozy first-person tidy up and organizing simulator where you sort 4,400+ fantasy dice and tabletop pieces. Solo or online co-op with up to 4 players, restore the Arcane Hall's 9 departments through relaxing, satisfying ASMR dice sounds and magic skills - no time limit.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/85a46a541bc851246367d49f1c50df99a534d164\/header.jpg?t=1793751756","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/131eacfca2b72b71ca72a9155fdac12240eeff05\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793751756","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/131eacfca2b72b71ca72a9155fdac12240eeff05\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793751756","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 <br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 <br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Smobu"],"publishers":["Smobu"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":489,"final":391,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"4,89€","final_formatted":"3,91€"},"packages":[1710086],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Dice Sort Together: Arcane Hall","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1710086,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Dice Sort Together: Arcane Hall - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">4,89€<\/span> 3,91€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":391}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/f02f5098819ca78c578f4bd82fc39807109a10f7\/ss_f02f5098819ca78c578f4bd82fc39807109a10f7.600x338.jpg?t=1793751756","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/f02f5098819ca78c578f4bd82fc39807109a10f7\/ss_f02f5098819ca78c578f4bd82fc39807109a10f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793751756"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/d87644ff9f74bdf8655f9acfaf662998cbc6813c\/ss_d87644ff9f74bdf8655f9acfaf662998cbc6813c.600x338.jpg?t=1793751756","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/d87644ff9f74bdf8655f9acfaf662998cbc6813c\/ss_d87644ff9f74bdf8655f9acfaf662998cbc6813c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793751756"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/09a2e0abfe1d6a88b384921b42075f63b008d4da\/ss_09a2e0abfe1d6a88b384921b42075f63b008d4da.600x338.jpg?t=1793751756","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4926160\/09a2e0abfe1d6a88b384921b42075f63b008d4da\/ss_09a2e0abfe1d6